# The frontend image builds from the REPOSITORY ROOT, not from v2/, because the games it serves
# are authored in examples/ and v2/ cannot reach above itself in a build context. Everything is
# excluded and the two directories the build reads are added back: a context that only grows when
# someone re-includes something is how 14 MB quietly becomes 400 MB.
*
!v2
!examples

# ...minus what is either huge, generated, or meaningless inside an image.
v2/node_modules
v2/dist
v2/.angular
v2/test-results
v2/playwright-report
examples/esgame-dynamic
